# resolver.claim — THE CLAIM, OUT OF THE EXTRACTOR AND OUT OF THE RULE.
#
# A regex over a CALLEE's bare name that says "this callee RESOLVES an entity
# from what it is handed". One pattern per line. The rule checks the domain
# against this list; it does not contain it. Adding a spelling here is a claim
# with an author, which is the point — the first extractor knew about walkers.
#
# Derived by reading the four commits of the June-July hand sweep (5bd2724c0,
# 5e9203add, 50a5cffd4, 8c10eb4e9) plus 060ef3736 / 1daeffa5b, which the
# handed-down list of four does not contain.
.*by_name.*
.*lookup.*
.*resolve.*
^find_.*
.*_symbol$
.*mangle.*
.*link_name.*
.*qualif.*
